meta {
  name: Follows - Chat - Get
  type: http
  seq: 169
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of a chat space>/messages/<cuid of a first-level message>/follow
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The follow state of the current member for a chat thread (#1475): `state` and `reason`, null without a row. A thread is a first-level message with its replies: a reply has none (422). A member who replies in a thread follows it, and so does the author of the first message from the first reply. Needs notifications:read.
}
